"""Open Knowledge Format project knowledge helpers.

The implementation intentionally supports a small, deterministic YAML
frontmatter profile.  It does not attempt to be a general YAML parser: emitted
SpecKit fields are flat scalars or inline scalar arrays, while unknown fields
are tolerated and preserved by metadata-only updates.
"""

